      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think there\u0027s an implicit justification missing from this commit message:\n\nWe can already set max-ready-age on the base label object, which means that it would apply to any nodes no matter how they are created.  The part I think is missing is that we may want to set different max-ready-age values for certain labels in different providers.\n\nThe test changes you made imply this reasoning, it\u0027s just not in the commit message, and it took me a moment to connect the two.",
